  "title": "Hearty Spicy Moroccan Kielbasa Tagine",
  "description": "A spicy and dense Moroccan dish featuring kielbasa, infused with aromatic oil, and cooked in a Korean brass bowl, this recipe is nut-free-friendly and perfect for a cozy dinner.",
